\nL162: # M Aspira – A New Serviced Apartment Project in Taman Desa\nL163: ## Refined Urban Living with New Condo in Taman Desa\nL164: \nL165: Do you ever find yourself longing for a break from the city’s endless rows of buildings while staying connected to urban convenience? M Aspira, a new serviced apartment in Taman Desa, offers a fresh take on modern condominium living. Designed for those seeking a balance between city life and personal retreat, it features intuitive layouts, efficient use of space, and an environment that prioritises comfort without excess.\nL166: ###### Show more\nL167: \nL168: Surrounded by greenery and parks, M Aspira is ideal for those prioritising a healthy lifestyle. You’ll have the perfect setting to maintain your active routine right outside your door. On top of that, Taman Desa’s strategic road links to Kuala Lumpur and Petaling Jaya allow for less time spent commuting and more time to enjoy the things that truly matter.\nL169: ## Prime Location Serviced Apartment for Sale in Taman Desa with Unmatched Accessibility\nL170: \nL171: In a time of increasing development and traffic, we designed M Aspira to ensure easy accessibility. Our location is well-connected to major highways like the SALAK Highway, Setiawangsa-Pantai Expressway, KL-Seremban Expressway, and the Federal Highway.\nL172: M Aspira’s cite9†strategic location and well-connected road networks give residents more flexibility in their daily routines. It offers the perfect balance of connectivity and accessibility while minimising time spent in traffic. Stay effortlessly connected to key destinations for work, leisure, and everything in between.\nL173: ## Elevated Lifestyle with Essential Condo Facilities in Taman Desa\nL174: \nL175: At M Aspira, we believe in providing more than just a home. With this in mind, we have thoughtfully designed cite3†modern facilities to bring you the best of serviced apartment living with premium condo features. From EV charging stations to a co-working space, these features have been curated to help you easily balance leisure and everyday tasks without leaving home.\nL176: When it’s time to unwind, immerse yourself in our 50m lap pool, let the bubbling jacuzzi melt away your stress, or bask in the sun on our cite8†scenic deck . Families can gather at the floating pavilion for quality moments together, while fitness lovers can break a sweat in our well-equipped gym.\nL177: Looking for entertainment? Challenge friends in the games room, host a dinner party or engross yourself with a book in the outdoor lounge. However your day unfolds, coming home should always feel effortless and fulfilling.\nL178: ## Newly Launched Taman Desa Condominium with Versatile Layouts for Every Preference\nL179: \nL180: M Aspira offers three layout options, and each is thoughtfully designed to suit different lifestyles. Type A (706 sqft) features 2 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms, and a balcony, ideal for singles, couples, or small families looking for a practical living space. Type B (855 sqft) comes with 3 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms, and a balcony, a great choice for growing families or those needing an extra room.\nL181: Type C (1006 sqft) offers 4 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms, and a balcony, perfect for larger families or those who want more space. Depending on the unit, residents can enjoy either a serene view of the building’s facilities and surrounding greenery or a panoramic view of the KL skyline.\nL182: ## Discover M Aspira, A New Serviced Apartment for Sale in Taman Desa Now!\nL183: \nL184: If you value the convenience and quality of condominium living, M Aspira offers modern amenities, well-designed layouts, and a living experience that truly complements your lifestyle. More than just a great location, it’s about finding a home that fits your needs effortlessly.\nL185: Explore M Aspira today and take the next step towards a home designed for comfort and connectivity.\nL186: \nL187: cite27†Image L188: \nL189: For further enquiries,